<title>JAPAN: Tokyo Sintered -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Sintered -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.34		vs	    5.29</p>
<p> Operating	  217    million	  vs	  195    million</p>
<p> Current	    254    million	  vs	  234    million</p>
